==English==

===Verb===
'''[[pull]] [[somebody|somebody’s]] [[leg]]'''

#{{idiom}} To [[tease]] someone; to lead someone on; to [[goad]] someone into over-reacting. Usually implies teasing or goading by [[jokingly]] [[lying]]

